    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Split out & Loop Items for Attachments\n\nThese nodes are the starting branch of processing attachments.\n\n**Split Out**: extract binary data (attachment).\n\n**Loop Over Items**: loops the entire branch once the first or preceeding attachment has been uploaded to the folder. Necessary for processing multiple attachments in an email.\n",
