      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Search, Filter & Conditional Nodes\n\nThese nodes are necessary to avoid duplication of folder creation.\n\n**Search files/folders**: Searches Label folder by id.\n\n**JS Code**: Filters the searched folders and returns a json obj.\n\n**IF**: Conditional flow if json object from Code node exists, it passed the flow on top branch to use existing label folder, else at bottom branch to create label folder.\n",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 544
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
